[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444891616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2444891616","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2444891616,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RuhXg","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-29T17:15:35Z","updated_at":"2024-10-29T17:17:13Z","body":"Yield has really poor performance on macOS. The function gets compiled down to sched_yield, which can yield the process to other processes running on the system. Lack of SIMT also means you can't yield work to other threads.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2444891616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2447776614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2447776614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2447776614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R5htm","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T16:46:04Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T16:46:04Z","body":"I've added a special implementation for Apple platforms.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2447776614/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448013942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2448013942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2448013942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R6bp2","user":{"login":"mrsaturnsan","id":32889818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODg5ODE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32889818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan","html_url":"https://github.com/mrsaturnsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrsaturnsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T18:23:43Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T18:27:57Z","body":"Thanks for looking into making changes.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, pthread_yield_np also messed with thread priorities :(\r\n\r\nThere's not really a good option, but you're better off spinning and burning cycles rather than yielding. Ideally you could use os_unfair_lock to let the scheduler know what thread another thread is waiting on.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448013942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448141466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2448141466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2448141466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6R66ya","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-30T19:15:28Z","updated_at":"2024-10-30T19:15:28Z","body":"> EditorNode::immediate_confirmation_dialog\r\n> editor/editor_log.cpp\r\n> EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQueryBlend\r\n> HTTPRequest::_thread_func\r\n> static_test_daemon\r\n\r\nI don't think busy waiting is needed or even appropriate in any of these cases (except *maybe* editor_log if it's invoked by multiple threads).\r\n\r\nMay I ask why this code isn't using a semaphore or condition variable or similar mechanism?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2448141466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2449494880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2449494880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2449494880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SAFNg","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-31T10:11:07Z","updated_at":"2024-10-31T10:11:07Z","body":"@mrsaturnsan, good point. I was misinformed that `pthread_yield_np()` was better on MacOS.\r\n\r\n@lyuma, you'be brought the greatest sanity here. Please check the updated description.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2449494880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460398883","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2460398883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2460398883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SprUj","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T17:40:13Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T17:40:13Z","body":"cc @adamscott regarding HTTPRequest in threaded mode. Will this be an issue on the web platform?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2460398883/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463075627","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2463075627","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2463075627,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sz40r","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T19:44:50Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T19:45:04Z","body":"I got this ~~error~~ warning while running a threaded `HTTPRequest` on the Web platform.\r\n\r\n```plain\r\nWARNING: HTTPClientWeb polled multiple times in one frame, but request cannot progress more than once per frame on the Web platform.\r\noverrideMethod @ hook.js:608\r\nonPrintError @ godot.editor.js:15281\r\nput_char @ godot.editor.js:1669\r\nwrite @ godot.editor.js:1618\r\nwrite @ godot.editor.js:3476\r\ndoWritev @ godot.editor.js:9118\r\n_fd_write @ godot.editor.js:9136\r\n__emscripten_receive_on_main_thread_js @ godot.editor.js:6214\r\n$run_js_func @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x3748754\r\n$call_then_finish_task @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x3748655\r\n$call_with_ctx @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x3748588\r\n$em_task_queue_execute @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x3747d5c\r\n$receive_notification @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x374804c\r\n$em_task_queue_execute @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x3747d5c\r\n$_emscripten_check_mailbox @ godot.web.editor.dev.wasm32.wasm-9a60df2e:0x3750d03\r\ncallUserCallback @ godot.editor.js:5748\r\ncheckMailbox @ godot.editor.js:5780\r\nPromise.then\r\n__emscripten_thread_mailbox_await @ godot.editor.js:5762\r\ncheckMailbox @ godot.editor.js:5779\r\nPromise.then\r\n__emscripten_thread_mailbox_await @ godot.editor.js:5762\r\ncheckMailbox @ godot.editor.js:5779\r\nPromise.then\r\n__emscripten_thread_mailbox_await @ godot.editor.js:5762\r\ncheckMailbox @ godot.editor.js:5779\r\n...\r\ngodot.editor.js:15281    at: poll (platform/web/http_client_web.cpp:240)\r\n```\r\n\r\nEither:\r\n- we shush the warning on the Web (kinda bad)\r\n- we check the capabilities of the platform to poll http requests before (relatively clean)\r\n- we just add a `#ifdef WEB_ENABLED` macro to force waiting (ugly as heck)\r\n\r\ncc. @Faless ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463075627/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463952728","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2463952728","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2463952728,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S3O9Y","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T07:30:44Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T07:30:44Z","body":"Wow, that check comes from seven years ago!: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/16781.\r\n\r\nBack them, HTTP requests on the web were backed by `XMLHttpRequest` instead of `fetch()`. I wonder if the limitation still holds. In any case, I wonder what's the harm of multiple pollings on the same frame. Was it to ensure `HTTPRequest` is implemented correctly?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463952728/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494771426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98385#issuecomment-2494771426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98385","id":2494771426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UszDi","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T20:48:57Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T20:48:57Z","body":"CC @Faless","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494771426/reactions","total_coun